    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d356-a1">

                <pb facs="0825" n="741" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg741"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 91.]</seg></opener>
                <p>The minister of finance has presented to the Second Chamber of the States General
                    a project tending to modify the present customs tariff of the Netherlands, as
                    follows: <table cols="5" rows="21">
                        <row role="label">
                            <cell rendition="#border-bottom #border-top #border-right" rows="2"
                                >Merchandise.</cell>
                            <cell cols="2" rendition="#border-bottom #border-top #border-right">New
                                tariff.</cell>
                            <cell cols="2" rendition="#border-bottom #border-top">Old tariff.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-bottom #border-top #border-right">Unit.</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-bottom #border-top #border-right">Rate.</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-bottom #border-top #border-right">Unit.</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-bottom #border-top">Rate.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Florins.</hi></cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell><hi rendition="#italic">Florins.</hi></cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Almonds</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">100 kilos</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">8</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">100 kilos</cell>
                            <cell role="num">4</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Lemon and orange peel preserved</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">do</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">6</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Value</cell>
                            <cell>5 per cent.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Ditto, not preserved</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">do</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">1.50</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Wood:</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Ship-building (fit for the construction
                                of naval and civil, imported by sea without breaking bulk).</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">The cubic meter</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">0.30</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">All other kinds, with the exception of
                                unsawn (fit for the construction of ships).</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Value</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">3 per cent.</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Raisins from Corinth</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">100 kilos</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">3</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">100 kilos</cell>
                            <cell>1.50</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Raisins, dried, not specially
                                denominated</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">do</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">4</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">do</cell>
                            <cell>2</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Petroleum</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">do</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">1</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Melon peel preserved</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">do</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">6</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell role="num">3</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Tea</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">do</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">40</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell role="num">25</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Figs</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">do</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">2</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell role="num">1</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Fruits and grapes not specially
                                tariffed</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Value</cell>
                            <cell>5 per cent.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Oranges from China</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">100 kilos</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">1.25</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Dates</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">do</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">1.40</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Chestnuts</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">do</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">1.20</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">Oranges</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right">do</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right" role="num">1</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right"/>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right #border-bottom">All other fruits</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right #border-bottom">Value</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right #border-bottom">5 per cent.</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-right #border-bottom"/>
                            <cell rendition="#border-bottom"/>
                        </row>
                    </table></p>
                <p>The product of the increase is estimated by the minister at the sum of one
                    million florins.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
</TEI>
